<title>AUSTRALIA: Normandy Mining tops turnover lists.</title>
<headline>Normandy Mining tops turnover lists.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in gold miner Normandy Mining Ltd topped turnover lists in afternoon trade on Monday with 15.1 million shares traded.</p>
<p>The bulk of the trade was in one line of 12.9 million specialled through ANZ Securities at a price of A$1.62 per share.</p>
<p>Brokers said the trade appeared to be normal institutional business.</p>
<p>By 2.10 p.m. (0410 GMT), Normandy shares were three cents higher at A$1.65.</p>
<p>--Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
